                    </div>
                    <h3 class="bundle-product-title text-base md:text-xl font-bold text-[#1F4C35] leading-snug line-clamp-2 h-[2.75rem] md:h-[3.5rem] mb-1" style="font-weight:700;">Radiance Ritual Shower Oil</h3>
